# Dew Theory Engineering

## Stack
- Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, Tailwind, Cloudflare Workers (OpenNext)
- Commerce durable layer: `lib/commerce/` (D1 production, file local)
- Skin Script modes: `mock` | `http` | `csv_feed` | `rpa`

## Supplier fulfillment
- Adapter factory: `lib/suppliers/skin-script/index.js`
- RPA adapter: `lib/suppliers/skin-script/rpa-adapter.js` → `services/skin-script-rpa/`
- Verified mappings: `lib/suppliers/skin-script/mapping.js`

## Security
- Internal HMAC: `lib/internal/hmac-auth.js` / RPA `app/security/hmac.py`
- No credentials in repo; update `.env.example` and `ENV.md` names only

## Tests
- Node: `npm test`
- Python RPA: `cd services/skin-script-rpa && pytest`

Preserve existing abstractions; extend rather than replace for style.
